# Defense-in-depth: refuse to commit private GPG material that may
# have leaked into this directory by accident. Public fingerprints
# (the .txt files) are committed and tracked; everything else is
# ignored.
#
# See docs/release/keys/README.md "What MUST NOT be committed here"
# and agile/handoff/governance/RELEASE_KEY_CUSTODY.md for the policy.

# Private key material
*.gpg
*.pgp
*.priv
*.private
secring.*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx

# Local YubiKey unlock state
.gnupg/
gnupg-keyring/
*.gnupg/

# Editor / OS noise
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Tracked fixtures (allowlist) — keep the public-facing files we
# explicitly want under version control.
!midnight-release-fingerprint.txt
!REVOKED-*.txt
!README.md
!.gitignore
